{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129150/extras/da6c8e2a2b7f36ed3c06a6793bc62dfc.avif?t=1759948581\" width=500 height=126 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be careful around strangers today\u2026 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At Nari\u2019s school, everyone is talking about a mysterious chat room that posts eerily accurate horoscopes\u2014foretelling events before they happen with chilling precision. The enigma of who writes these predictions only deepens the intrigue. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But when the predictions turn dark and murders start occurring, Nari realizes the horoscopes might be more than just creepy coincidences. As the deadly patterns unfold, Nari must uncover the truth before the next prediction is about her. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who is behind the chilling forecasts, and can Nari escape becoming the next victim? Dive into a suspenseful web of secrets and lies where every forecast could be your last! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129150/extras/e1e12448c9c35a0c409b85e83df02f3a.avif?t=1759948581\" width=500 height=126 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Get Ready for a Thrilling Throwback with Super Chillers: The Chat Room!</i></strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a nostalgic point-and-click adventure that\u2019s dripping with suspense and retro charm. Explore eerie locations, encounter a host of quirky characters, and solve mind-bending puzzles \u2013 but beware, the killer is always lurking! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by classic YA horror series like Fear Street and Point Horror, Super Chillers delivers a campy, spine-tingling experience straight from the 1990s. Are you ready to relive the chills and thrills? The clock is ticking, and the horror is just beginning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129150/extras/1f25535f7db8d475d4ba76c64e2d1e33.avif?t=1759948581\" width=500 height=126 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tackle satisfying puzzles as you search for secrets and clues</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into an eerie and compelling narrative that keeps you hooked.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight to save your friends... and yourself... before it's too late</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the story with full English voice performances.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a nostalgic setting with classic pixel art environments</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129150/extras/a444eb293783298ed502ff16831ae880.avif?t=1759948581\" width=604 height=460 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3129150?t=1759948581","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3129150?t=1759948581","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129150/aa63bbca4d93551a750f7069924b30f82d0e0d51/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759948581","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129150/aa63bbca4d93551a750f7069924b30f82d0e0d51/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759948581","categories":[{"description":"Si